Force of Nature never changed from its debut in '''Alpha 3.0'''. At least, that was the case until '''Beta 7.3''', where its cost dropped from 1G to 0G. This was returned to 1G in '''Beta 29.0'''. '''Beta 52.1''' gave its its first effect change.
Before, it simply gave +3 HP to a monster (on the board) of your choice. Now, enemy monsters can't be targeted. Additionally, it can also be used on you yourself, boosting your own current and max HP. However, the player boost is only +2 HP. '''Beta 53.0''' increased the player boost to the same +3 as the monster boost. (This change was noted as a rework rather than a buff for some reason.)
=== Stats ===
