* 1 (Post Beta 29.0, Current)
Effects:
* Give +3 HP to a monster. (Post Alpha 3.0)
* Give +3 HP to an ally monster or +2 HP to you. (Post Beta 52.1)
* Give +3 HP to an ally. (Post Beta 53.0, Current)

Rarities:
* White (Common) (Post Alpha 3.0)
* Gray (Basic) (Post Beta 30.0, Current)

